- [x] `SCRIBE-DRY-APPLY-P1.DOCS`: architecture, phase plan, checklist, and manifest are populated and cross-linked. Proof: `ARCHITECTURE_GUIDE.md`, `PHASE_PLAN.md`, `CHECKLIST.md`, `WORK_ITEMS.md`.
- [x] `SCRIBE-DRY-APPLY-P1.BASELINE`: current dirty rehome and 2.13.2 candidate files are enumerated and preserved. Proof: architecture Requirements and Scribe decision checkpoint.
